      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test. The main issues are:\n- All data arrays are crammed onto a single line — nearly unreadable\n- Many unused data-provider methods and their corresponding imports add noise\n- The only test is `test_plusDays`, which only uses `data_samples()`The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version improves understandability by: formatting each `data_samples()` row on its own line with grouping comments that explain each boundary case, removing the seven unused data-provider methods and their associated imports, and adding brief Javadoc explaining the test's intent and the offsets under test."
